# The complexity gate: `make quality-check`. A method above 20 that is not in the baseline fails, and so does a
# baseline entry that no longer matches (fixed, or its score changed: the message holds the score). The baseline may
# only shrink. After fixing a method, or when a baselined score moves, run `make quality-baseline`.
# See phpstan-complexity-limits.neon.
includes:
    - phpstan-complexity-limits.neon
    - phpstan-complexity-baseline.neon
